とうございました。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@xi1eo/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/4a09e9c9/uploads/origins/4480be58-8998-4a24-b412-1d286ef50f92?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0dc9b8049c93910347d7fbd4b842bd45", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4a09e9c9/uploads/origins/4480be58-8998-4a24-b412-1d286ef50f92?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0dc9b8049c93910347d7fbd4b842bd45, https://si.imgix.net/4a09e9c9/uploads/origins/4480be58-8998-4a24-b412-1d286ef50f92?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=da67f2ad02cfba10dbd6958500633a77 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4a09e9c9/uploads/origins/4480be58-8998-4a24-b412-1d286ef50f92?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f1dba460cb185a7552e6f5adf29f9231 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "I'm glad to have received your appeal! I like your art style a lot!\nI'd like you to draw my OC Mel going for a run to exercise at night in winter. \nSo instead of her usual outfit she would be wearing a white hoodie, black tights on her legs and a brown cross-body bag around her abdomen. Due to having large breasts, the combination of the loose hoodie and the strap of the cross-body bag on he midsection, her chest creates a sheer cliff that moves around quite a bit. She is running at night while it is snowing and her breath is visible in the air.  Her expression is determined! Be sure to cheer her on! \nI am very excited to see your work!\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/bIlEmGB", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@xi1eo/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d3013bf1/uploads/origins/a06cc078-d78d-4c9e-b944-75488910f23a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=164829acda1bffbe1c38498b3a193d79", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d3013bf1/uploads/origins/a06cc078-d78d-4c9e-b944-75488910f23a?b